# The model assets never live in this directory.
#
# They are 2.0 GB of upstream build products (QNN EPContext pairs + the fp32
# embedding table + tokenizer), not source.  They are fetched by the separate
# qwen35-npu-model recipe, which pulls every file from HuggingFace
# (PrismPhi/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Radxa-Dragon-Q6A-QCS6490-QNN-NPU) at a pinned commit
# during do_fetch and verifies each one against a sha256 in the recipe.  DL_DIR
# is the only place they are cached; nothing here is ever committed, and at
# runtime they are installed into /usr/share/qwen35.
#
# There is no "build the model locally, drop it in files/model/" path any more:
# the CPU / ONNX Runtime int8 plan that used this directory (qwen08b_i8.onnx,
# kvc.bin, emb08_f16.npy) was removed.  The ignore rule is kept only so a stale
# working tree that still has files/model/ cannot be committed by accident.
files/model/

# py_compile / imports while editing qwen35-mkconfig.py, the runtime/ modules or
# the helper scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
